      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e99366316eb8207b3614109",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "解谜能让观众参与游戏。\n推动跨社交平台的解谜游戏，\n可以在各个媒体增加曝光度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "289634573cbbb34f158edc5c983792e2552967799ba112407a7f7e8ad672a7d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1038/storytimeline_501038800.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1603ceab2d8b5c13b106136f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回顾闪耀系列赛的照片后，\n我发现她的光芒越来越耀眼……\n变得更加可爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b6758e4046a0ee79941e1a617b2751ec0d5f68356f23bc0cb506893067098b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1038/storytimeline_501038800.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efccf702cbba2cb60ee93a01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这证明了她的努力。\n她的可爱带给所有人幸福，\n这份幸福也回报在她的身上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8791449370eee7ee1eb33f468d98a748342f0457cdf103c4b6f1826784719156",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1038/storytimeline_501038800.json",
      "json_path": [
